      REAL       VSEA
      COMMON /M/ VSEA(LH)       !VELOCITY AT SEA LEVEL (CRV)
      REAL       THICK
      COMMON /M/ THICK(LH)      !THICKNESS OF HALFSPACE (CRV)
      REAL       VHALF
